caption: Refinement
technology-rule: refinement

Advanced designers may use their excess capability to improve a formula.

Refinement Budget = Effective Talent - Required Talent

Refinement is assigned when the chem is invented. The allocation becomes a permanent property of that formula.

Refinement may be spent on:

Addiction Refinement

Cost Refinement

Clearance Refinement

Let:

(R_A) = Refinement spent on addiction.

(R_C) = Refinement spent on cost.

(R_Cl) = Refinement spent on clearance.

Then:

R_A + R_C + R_Cl <= Refinement Budget

Refinement may be left unspent. Crude, rushed, black-market, or intentionally addictive formulas often waste available Refinement.
